Subject: [PATCH 16/22] ducksteps PGO: correct the corpus last-updated date

Bumps the header date to match the last corpus change. The absolute path
comment that came with this edit is deliberately not included: this file
syncs to Docs/PGO/background.js in the public repo on every release, so
it would have published the maintainer's local disk layout to describe a
location the repo already makes obvious.
